This skill is a derivative work. It restructures, condenses and extends material from the
sources below into a router with reference files. Changes: the material was rewritten into one
routing skill, merged across sources, extended with a throttled KEGG client
(scripts/kegg_rest.py, original code), cross-database identifier routes, metabolomics and
RNA-based prediction guidance, and rate limits checked against live API responses.

